rcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5_Icon.webp/40px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5_Icon.webp/60px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/8c/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5_Icon.webp/80px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spell Slot Restoration Level 5\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/8c/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5_Icon.webp/40px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/8c/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_5\" title=\"Spell Slot Restoration Level 5\">Spell Slot Restoration Level 5</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_6\" title=\"Spell Slot Restoration Level 6\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_6_Icon.webp/40px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_6_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_6_Icon.webp/60px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_6_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/a/ab/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_6_Icon.webp/80px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_6_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Spell Slot Restoration Level 6\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/a/ab/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_6_Icon.webp/40px-Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_6_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/a/ab/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_6_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Spell_Slot_Restoration_Level_6\" title=\"Spell Slot Restoration Level 6\">Spell Slot Restoration Level 6</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Granted by items:\n</p>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-block\" style=\"gap: 6px\"><span class=\"nowrap bg3wiki-icontext-icon\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-itemicon bg3wiki-itemicon-very-rare\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Spellcrux_Amulet\" title=\"Spellcrux Amulet\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/45px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/1/13/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/60px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/1/13/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png/30px-Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/1/13/Amulet_Necklace_D_Gold_A_1_Unfaded_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span></span><a href=\"/wiki/Spellcrux_Amulet\" title=\"Spellcrux Amulet\">Spellcrux Amulet</a></span> </li>\n</ul>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This ability restores both a regular spell slot and a <a href=\"/wiki/Warlock\" title=\"Warlock\">Warlock</a> spell slot of the level chosen.</li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Bugs\"> Bugs </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>This bug is not specific to the Spellcrux Amulet, but it is arguably related enough to mention here: respeccing a spellcasting character with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/38px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/50px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Withers\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png/25px-Portrait_Withers.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/25/Portrait_Withers.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Withers\" title=\"Withers\">Withers</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/Camp\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Camp\">camp</a> back to their same class and level will also restore all their depleted spell slots (at all levels). This can be done as often as desired, as long as one has the gold to pay for it.</li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715041950\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.083 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.088 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 4027/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 52521/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 17814/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 4/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 34/1000\nLua time usage: 0.035/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1438437/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   73.420      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   73.420      1 -total\n 94.88%   69.662     49 Template:Trim\n 20.13%   14.783      1 Template:SmRarityItem\n 17.57%   12.900      2 Template:Item_icon\n 17.52%   12.865      9 Template:Icon_text\n 15.80%   11.598      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 14.44%   10.599      7 Template:Icon_link\n 14.04%   10.308      6